Subject: [qnx-porter 0002] guard-linux-header
Source: deterministic rule
Reason: <endian.h> does not exist on QNX 8.0 and isobusfs/isobusfs_cmn.h uses nothing from it, so the include is kept for Linux and skipped on QNX.
Error: /home/chirag/qnx-porter/ports/can-utils/work/src/isobusfs/isobusfs_cmn.h:8:10: fatal error: endian.h: No such file or directory
---
diff --git a/isobusfs/isobusfs_cmn.h b/isobusfs/isobusfs_cmn.h
index 23fa582..7ad3762 100644
--- a/isobusfs/isobusfs_cmn.h
+++ b/isobusfs/isobusfs_cmn.h
@@ -5,7 +5,9 @@
 #define _ISOBUSFS_H_
 
 #include <stdint.h>
+#ifndef __QNX__  /* qnx-porter: <endian.h> is Linux-only */
 #include <endian.h>
+#endif
 #include <stdbool.h>
 
 #include <linux/can.h>
